# Copy to ~/.config/moonrush/.env, or export these.
# Environment variables win over the file.

# THE CREDENTIAL. `<key id>.<secret>` from https://moonrush.space/ai/keys
#
# Anything that is one person's (wallet, positions, earnings, trading) also needs the key to
# have the "Trading and private data" tier AND a signing key on this machine:
#   moonrush-cli config --generate-key
# The private half never leaves the machine. Treat this file as a secret either way.
MOONRUSH_API_KEY=
